          "id": "41d27917e8b5d41a9a6461b353131d74057a75d5",
          "message": "Use brood-box wolfi base for mecatui ko builds (#225)\n\nThe distroless cgr.dev/chainguard/static image has no shell or SSH\ndaemon, which brood-box requires to connect to the VM. Override the\nbase image for mecatui to ghcr.io/stacklok/brood-box/base:latest.\n\nBuild with: KO_DOCKER_REPO=ko.local KO_DEFAULTPLATFORMS=linux/arm64 \\\n  ko build --base-import-paths github.com/stacklok/mecatl/cmd/mecatui\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
