          "message": "docs(scheduler): Phase 2b — flip production-readiness to shipped + e2e declarative test\n\nUpdate living docs to reflect the three Phase 2b pillars (settings.yaml schedules:\nblock, mecated schedules CLI, schedule metrics) and add an end-to-end test through\napp.Build for the declarative → store path.\n\n- docs/design/PRODUCTION-READINESS.md: ⛔ Phase 2b → ✅ shipped\n- docs/design/IMPLEMENTATION-NOTES.md: Phase 2b subsection (config + CLI + metrics)\n- docs/usage.md: settings.yaml schedules syntax + CLI examples (shipped status)\n- docs/architecture.md: declarative config + CLI section\n- internal/app/schedules_declarative_test.go: e2e through app.Build — operator-tier\n  settings.yaml → foldOperatorSchedules → reconcileSchedules → store; idempotent\n  re-reconcile (no churn); project-tier schedules ignored (operator-tier-only)\n\nPart of #189. Closes #233.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Juan Osorio Ortiz <jaosorior@gmail.com>",
