          "message": "chore(release): bump reusable-workflow pins v0.0.13 -> v0.0.14 + engine changelog v0.5.0 (#268)\n\n- Bump the three sibling-action @vX.Y.Z pins in mecatequi-reusable.yml\n  and EXPECTED_TAG in check-reusable-pins.sh v0.0.13 -> v0.0.14.\n- Move engine [Unreleased] additive surface (scheduled-tasks Phase 2a\n  ports, session.Title, MetaLister, typed tool-result Parts, SSRF\n  ValidateResolvedIP, etc.) to [0.5.0] - 2026-07-16 (minor, all Added\n  per COMPATIBILITY.md).\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>",
