          "message": "docs(agents): note user-docs/ in the workflow checklist\n\nuser-docs/ (the public Docusaurus site content) was never mentioned in\nAGENTS.md's documentation-lifecycle guidance or its Workflow checklist,\nunlike docs/. Easy to forget since nothing gates on it automatically,\nunlike llms.txt/task generate for docs/. Surfaced by PR #294, where two\nuser-docs pages had gone stale describing a feature they predated.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
