          "message": "docs(engine): drop orphaned conflict marker in CHANGELOG (#296)\n\nA botched merge resolution in 735ebeb3 (merging origin/main into\nmodel-router-gaps-285-288) committed a lone '<<<<<<< HEAD' marker into the\n[Unreleased] section. Both sides of the conflict (the #206 plan-gate entries\nand the #285-#287 router entries) were fully retained — only the marker line\nwas spurious. Remove it.\n\nCo-authored-by: mecatl <noreply@stacklok.com>",
