          "id": "ec54eeadda4b559415f5a7910a38b9bd96d67f74",
          "message": "ci: deploy mecatl.dev to S3 + CloudFront via OIDC on push to main (#300)\n\nBuilds the Docusaurus site in website/ and publishes it to the AWS\nhosting provisioned in stacklok/infra (private S3 bucket mecatl-dev-site\nbehind CloudFront E1CIKTNUUCD4K4 with an edge Basic Auth gate). Auth is\nGitHub OIDC assuming github_actions_mecatl_role — no static AWS creds.\n\nDeploys only on push to main (no branch/preview deploys); workflow_dispatch\nis a manual redeploy hatch. Requires a `production` GitHub Environment\n(the role trust is scoped to it) and the infra KMS grant.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>",
