          "id": "cb863e3376885634410da37b27a0160e14ab6992",
          "message": "feat(openai-codex): OpenAI OAuth/subscription login support (#493)\n\n* docs(openai-codex): record manual token compatibility\n\nCo-authored-by: OpenAI Codex <noreply@openai.com>\n\n* feat(authfile): accept manual Codex OAuth snapshots\n\nCo-authored-by: OpenAI Codex <noreply@openai.com>\n\n* feat(openai-codex): add immutable request policy\n\nCo-authored-by: OpenAI Codex <noreply@openai.com>\n\n* feat(openai-codex): wire manual credentials\n\nCo-authored-by: OpenAI Codex <noreply@openai.com>\n\n* feat(openai-codex): register subscription provider\n\nCo-authored-by: OpenAI Codex <noreply@openai.com>\n\n* feat(openai-codex): add entitlement model discovery\n\nCo-authored-by: OpenAI Codex <noreply@openai.com>\n\n* feat(openai-codex): close responses replay gaps\n\nCo-authored-by: OpenAI Codex <noreply@openai.com>\n\n* feat(openai-codex): prove composition and operator surfaces\n\nCo-authored-by: OpenAI Codex <noreply@openai.com>\n\n* docs(openai-codex): publish manual token operations\n\nCo-authored-by: OpenAI Codex <noreply@openai.com>\n\n* fix(openai-codex): use compatible models client version\n\n* test(openai-codex): follow packed reasoning replay\n\n* refactor(openai-codex): centralize request policy\n\n* refactor(openai-codex): simplify credential snapshots\n\n* test(openai-codex): consolidate auth fixtures\n\n* docs(openai-codex): trim compatibility evidence\n\n* chore(mecatui): restore local version stamping\n\n* refactor(openai-codex): keep credentials opaque\n\n* docs(openai-codex): renumber decision as ADR 0104\n\n* refactor: trim codex provider scaffolding\n\n* docs: regenerate llms index\n\n* Rebase again\n\n* chore(rebase): reconcile main composition wiring\n\nCo-Authored-By: OpenAI <noreply@openai.com>\n\n* docs: remove stale acceptance link\n\nCo-Authored-By: OpenAI <noreply@openai.com>\n\n* docs: regenerate llms index after rebase\n\nCo-Authored-By: OpenAI <noreply@openai.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: OpenAI Codex <noreply@openai.com>",
