          "id": "68bf0e6110316922c525fe6a735388bf9ffe1d1e",
          "message": "feat(authority): enforce delegated capability sets (#673)\n\n* feat(governance): add the capability set algebra\n\nCo-Authored-By: mecatl <noreply@mecatl.dev>\n\n* feat(port): define the authority evaluator contract\n\nCo-Authored-By: mecatl <noreply@mecatl.dev>\n\n* feat(adapter): add noop and local evaluators with a conformance suite\n\nCo-Authored-By: mecatl <noreply@mecatl.dev>\n\n* feat(session): carry derived authority on the aggregate\n\nCo-Authored-By: mecatl <noreply@mecatl.dev>\n\n* feat(tool): add the authority resource resolver seam\n\nCo-Authored-By: mecatl <noreply@mecatl.dev>\n\n* feat(agent): enforce authority at the execute chokepoint\n\nCo-Authored-By: mecatl <noreply@mecatl.dev>\n\n* feat(agent): derive attenuated authority at every delegation seam\n\nCo-Authored-By: mecatl <noreply@mecatl.dev>\n\n* feat(cedar): add the opt-in Cedar authority adapter\n\nCo-Authored-By: mecatl <noreply@mecatl.dev>\n\n* feat(app): mint the root authority and thread it through composition\n\nCo-Authored-By: mecatl <noreply@mecatl.dev>\n\n* feat(mecated): add authority evaluator flags\n\nCo-Authored-By: mecatl <noreply@mecatl.dev>\n\n* test(app): add the authority vertical slice\n\nCo-Authored-By: mecatl <noreply@mecatl.dev>\n\n* docs(authority): record ADR 0232, the plan, and the operator surface\n\nCo-Authored-By: mecatl <noreply@mecatl.dev>\n\n* chore(lint): scope depguard to the session tier and match cmd in worktrees\n\nCo-Authored-By: mecatl <noreply@mecatl.dev>\n\n* chore(plan): record orchestration state and review records\n\nCo-Authored-By: mecatl <noreply@mecatl.dev>\n\n* docs(authority): renumber ADR to 0233 after rebase\n\nCo-Authored-By: mecatl <noreply@mecatl.dev>\n\n* docs(authority): explain execution flow\n\nCo-Authored-By: mecatl <noreply@mecatl.dev>\n\n* docs(authority): add deployer guide\n\nCo-Authored-By: mecatl <noreply@mecatl.dev>\n\n* docs(authority): renumber ADR after rebase\n\nCo-Authored-By: mecatl <noreply@mecatl.dev>\n\n* fix(app): adapt authority wiring after rebase\n\nCo-Authored-By: mecatl <noreply@mecatl.dev>\n\n* fix(app): restore authority wiring after rebase\n\nCo-Authored-By: mecatl <noreply@mecatl.dev>\n\n* docs: regenerate llms index\n\nCo-Authored-By: mecatl <noreply@mecatl.dev>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: mecatl <noreply@mecatl.dev>",
