          "message": "docs: consolidate feature and deployment documentation (#741)\n\n* Add feature documentation scaffolds\n\nCreate a user-oriented feature tree and capability matrix scaffold for the docs reorganization.\\n\\nCo-Authored-By: OpenAI <noreply@openai.com>\n\n* Record feature documentation roadmap\n\nKeep the capability inventory, classification review, user-journey writing order, and validation steps alongside the feature scaffolds.\\n\\nCo-Authored-By: OpenAI <noreply@openai.com>\n\n* docs: add mecatui user guide\n\nCo-Authored-By: OpenAI <noreply@openai.com>\n\n* docs: document sessions and model selection\n\nCo-Authored-By: OpenAI <noreply@openai.com>\n\n* docs: add named agent guide\n\nCo-Authored-By: OpenAI <noreply@openai.com>\n\n* docs: add permissions and posture guide\n\nCo-Authored-By: OpenAI <noreply@openai.com>\n\n* docs: explain skills commands and soul\n\nCo-Authored-By: OpenAI <noreply@openai.com>\n\n* docs: explain execution environments and background bash\n\nCo-Authored-By: OpenAI <noreply@openai.com>\n\n* docs: expand continuity scheduling and MCP credentials\n\nCo-Authored-By: OpenAI <noreply@openai.com>\n\n* docs: document caller identity and learning\n\nCo-Authored-By: OpenAI <noreply@openai.com>\n\n* docs: document dreaming and memory consolidation\n\nCo-Authored-By: OpenAI <noreply@openai.com>\n\n* docs: document multimodal input and context windows\n\nCo-Authored-By: OpenAI <noreply@openai.com>\n\n* docs: refine model selection and remove OpenRouter page\n\nCo-Authored-By: OpenAI <noreply@openai.com>\n\n* docs: explain project instructions and rules\n\nCo-Authored-By: OpenAI <noreply@openai.com>\n\n* docs: simplify capability matrix\n\nCo-Authored-By: OpenAI <noreply@openai.com>\n\n* docs: clarify shared deployment core\n\nCo-Authored-By: OpenAI <noreply@openai.com>\n\n* docs: remove internal feature roadmap\n\nCo-Authored-By: OpenAI <noreply@openai.com>\n\n* docs: add feature authoring contract\n\nCo-Authored-By: OpenAI <noreply@openai.com>\n\n* docs: clarify API contract discovery\n\nCo-Authored-By: OpenAI <noreply@openai.com>\n\n* docs: route API clients to source contracts\n\nCo-Authored-By: OpenAI <noreply@openai.com>\n\n* docs: repair API reference links\n\nCo-Authored-By: OpenAI <noreply@openai.com>\n\n* docs: repair links after docs restructure\n\nCo-Authored-By: OpenAI <noreply@openai.com>\n\n* docs: consolidate deployment guidance\n\nCo-Authored-By: OpenAI <noreply@openai.com>\n\n* docs: consolidate session guidance\n\nCo-Authored-By: OpenAI <noreply@openai.com>\n\n* docs: centralize workspace semantics\n\nCo-Authored-By: OpenAI <noreply@openai.com>\n\n* docs: separate MCP runtime and credentials\n\nCo-Authored-By: OpenAI <noreply@openai.com>\n\n* docs: separate memory concepts and TUI commands\n\nCo-Authored-By: OpenAI <noreply@openai.com>\n\n* docs: separate schedule usage and mechanics\n\nCo-Authored-By: OpenAI <noreply@openai.com>\n\n* docs: clarify governance page boundaries\n\nCo-Authored-By: OpenAI <noreply@openai.com>\n\n* docs: correct deployment and API guidance\n\nCo-Authored-By: OpenAI <noreply@openai.com>\n\n* docs: update engine run examples\n\nCo-Authored-By: OpenAI <noreply@openai.com>\n\n* docs: correct engine module surface\n\nCo-Authored-By: OpenAI <noreply@openai.com>\n\n* docs: correct observability and schedule semantics\n\nCo-Authored-By: OpenAI <noreply@openai.com>\n\n* docs: clarify event log ownership\n\nCo-Authored-By: OpenAI <noreply@openai.com>\n\n* docs: clarify embedding adapter boundaries\n\nCo-Authored-By: OpenAI <noreply@openai.com>\n\n* docs: clarify conditional write semantics\n\nCo-Authored-By: OpenAI <noreply@openai.com>\n\n* docs: document crash-orphaned session recovery\n\nCo-Authored-By: OpenAI <noreply@openai.com>\n\n* docs: finish schedule API corrections\n\nCo-Authored-By: OpenAI <noreply@openai.com>\n\n* docs: correct delegation and lease guidance\n\nCo-Authored-By: OpenAI <noreply@openai.com>\n\n* docs: refresh generated documentation index\n\nCo-Authored-By: OpenAI <noreply@openai.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: OpenAI <noreply@openai.com>",
