          "id": "b7fdadecc68c08c192c3ddfb8da246463b1228c5",
          "message": "feat(mecak8s): add imagePullSecrets support to the Helm chart (#776)\n\nThe chart had no way to reference an image-pull Secret, so a real\ncluster deploy from a private registry (e.g. ghcr.io/stacklok/mecatl)\nwould ImagePullBackOff with no values-level fix available — only\nexercised via the disposable Kind fixture's locally-loaded ko.local\nimage and CI's k8s-e2e.yml, neither of which ever pulls from a real\nregistry. Mirrors atrium/airlock's chart shape.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
