          "message": "feat(mecak8s): harden production TLS lifecycle and chart controls (#800)\n\n* feat(mecak8s): harden production TLS lifecycle\n\nCo-Authored-By: Juan Antonio Osorio <ozz@stacklok.com>\n\n* fix(mecak8s): retain valid rotated credentials\n\nCo-Authored-By: Juan Antonio Osorio <ozz@stacklok.com>\n\n* fix(mecak8s): close rotation review gaps\n\nCo-Authored-By: Juan Antonio Osorio <ozz@stacklok.com>\n\n* fix(mecak8s): wire production provider fixtures\n\nCo-Authored-By: Juan Antonio Osorio <ozz@stacklok.com>\n\n* test(mecak8s): isolate TLS fixture from provider posture\n\nCo-Authored-By: Juan Antonio Osorio <ozz@stacklok.com>\n\n* fix(mecak8s): address TLS lifecycle review\n\nCo-Authored-By: Juan Antonio Osorio <ozz@stacklok.com>\n\n* docs: renumber mecak8s reload ADR\n\nCo-Authored-By: Juan Antonio Osorio <ozz@stacklok.com>\n\n* docs: regenerate llms index after rebase\n\nCo-Authored-By: Juan Antonio Osorio <ozz@stacklok.com>",
