          "id": "735a517e285f25f7723f01a33183f4de15988ebb",
          "message": "feat(mecatui): detect light terminal backgrounds (#938)\n\ndetect the terminal background through Bubble Tea when no theme is explicitly selected\nautomatically switch mecatui to the existing solar theme on light backgrounds\npreserve explicit --theme/MECATUI_THEME choices and avoid OSC queries on redirected stdout\nrefresh renderer caches and spinner styling when the runtime theme changes\ndocument the behavior in ADR 0280 and the TUI/user guides\ncloses: Add light mode support for the TUI #745",
