          "message": "feat: add persistent read-before-write ledgers (#946)\n\nseparate read-before-write evidence from filesystem content by carrying a mandatory tool.ReadLedger on each execution environment\nadd in-memory and Redis-backed ledger implementations with conformance, persistence, corruption, identity, and cleanup coverage\npreserve fresh child evidence across Subagent, Parallel, and Team paths while retaining each child’s actual content backend and path-containment boundary\nupdate ADR 0290, architecture references, acceptance criteria, API baseline, changelog, and generated documentation surfaces",
