          "message": "chore(ci): bump matlatl docs gate v0.0.5 -> v0.0.7 (#243)\n\nThe only code change between v0.0.5 and v0.0.7 is in\ninternal/infrastructure/emit/fixprompt.go (4 lines, unrelated to the\ncheck gate). The rest is docs, research, the matlatl skill's own\nSKILL.md, and the release workflow.\n\nVerified the gate semantics are preserved: a deliberately-introduced\ndead-end document still fails under v0.0.7 --strict (exit 1, 'findings\npresent'), the same as v0.0.5. Clean main passes under both versions.",
