          "message": "fix(mecatui): light up the /models picker for uncatalogued providers (#284)\n\nModelSelection gated on len(currentModels())>0, read once at CreateSession.\nUncatalogued providers (ToolHive gateway, OpenCode Go) have an empty static\ncatalog seed and are filled only by the async live refresh, so a session\ncreated in the create-races-the-swap window froze the picker off for its whole\nlife (caps are never refetched). Also OR in a wired model refresher —\ncomposition wires one whenever an available provider has a live lister —\nmatching the client's documented \"≥1 provider available\" semantics. Opening the\npicker fires ListModels, which runs the refresher and fills the list.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
