          "id": "71e68ef10f47ba91d2ffa00f29238cd93092d383",
          "message": "fix(osfs): accept macOS system path aliases (#353)\n\nVet relaxed paths component by component so top-level aliases such as /var to /private/var are accepted without laundering nested symlink escapes.\n\nNormalize only the top-level alias when matching canonical read roots, and keep relaxed writes fail-closed for read-only roots and unverifiable paths.\n\nFixes #349",
