          "id": "ef8d62c287aecca35b80b6a93ef44a024c730115",
          "message": "feat(session): persist the terminal failure cause on the session snapshot (#332) (#405)\n\nA background subagent whose end-emit loses the race with the run-end seal\n(drainChildren's abortEmits) had its StopError cause dropped from every\ndurable surface: the parent's subagent.end event never lands, child runs\nare never relayed to the EventLog, and the persisted child snapshot\ncarried only state/stop_reason. The cause was unrecoverable.\n\nPersist it on the child snapshot, the Permanent-analog:\nSession.RecordLastError/LastError stamps the terminal cause on a failed\nsession (StateFailed-only guard, cleared on Recover/resetToIdle),\nnormalised to one line + clamped to 400 runes (the session-local mirror\nof the event-side subagentCausePayload, pinned byte-for-byte by a\ntwo-sided agreement test). It round-trips on sessnap.Snapshot.LastError\n(RestoreState trailing param, additive omitempty) and the eventsource\nfold captures EvResult.Error on a StopError terminal. engine/agent\nrecords the cause before persistChild on BOTH the foreground run() and\nbackground driveBackground paths — belt-and-suspenders for the former,\nload-bearing for the latter. The drain/seal timing invariants are\nunchanged (the fix is durability on the snapshot, not winning the emit\nrace); the pre-run endOnError site (no child session) rides the event\nonly — the accepted boundary.\n\nEngine public surface: RecordLastError/LastError are Added (minor) per\nCOMPATIBILITY.md — api/session.txt regenerated, CHANGELOG entry added.\nNo proto change (the cause already rides SubagentPayload.Cause /\nTeamPayload.Cause on the wire).\n\nCo-authored-by: mecatl <mecatl@stacklok.com>",
