          "message": "fix(agent): report incomplete subagent terminals honestly (#466)\n\n* fix(agent): report incomplete subagent terminals honestly\n\n* fix(agent): extend honest terminal reporting to Parallel; correct ADR citation\n\nParallel's default stop-reason arm rendered every bounded/anomalous branch\nterminal (max-turns, budget, timeout, unknown host label) as an unqualified\n\"[OK]\" success, the same silent-success defect issue #422 fixed for\nSubagent. Reuse subagentTerminalNote so a Parallel branch that didn't\ncleanly finish carries a partial/incomplete note before the parent picks a\nwinner among branches.\n\nAlso corrects ~22 comments in subagent.go that cited \"ADR 0041\" for the\ndirect-write Subagent mode — that ADR is unrelated (output-economy default\nprompt); the direct-write mode is documented in ADR 0077.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Jakub Hrozek <jakub@stacklok.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
