          "message": "fix(app): isolate conventional config tests (#502)\n\nConventional permission-config discovery reads the user's XDG settings in addition to project configuration. Tests that exercise it therefore inherited local model and guardrail settings, making their results machine-dependent.\n\nAllow app composition to inject the XDG resolution environment while retaining the production OSEnv default. Configure affected tests with an empty temporary environment and prove injected user-global settings still participate in the Build fold. Isolate the related trust resolver in posture tests as well.",
