          "message": "feat(mecatui): make session continuity first-class (#550)\n\n* docs(plan): define session continuity UX contract\n\n* chore(plan): decompose session continuity waves\n\n* chore(plan): start session taxonomy task\n\n* feat(session): add durable session taxonomy\n\n* chore(plan): complete session taxonomy task\n\n* chore(plan): dispatch session foundation wave\n\n* fix(server): gate session runs by purpose\n\n* chore(plan): complete run-purpose gates\n\n* feat(server): expose authoritative session transcript\n\n* chore(plan): complete transcript task\n\n* feat(server): paginate session inventory\n\n* chore(plan): complete paged inventory task\n\n* chore(plan): dispatch session UI wave\n\n* feat(mecatui): make session discovery honest\n\n* chore(plan): complete sessions overlay task\n\n* feat(mecatui): expose active session details\n\n* chore(plan): complete active session details\n\n* chore(plan): dispatch startup resume task\n\n* feat(mecatui): resume stored sessions at startup\n\n* chore(plan): complete startup resume task\n\n* chore(plan): dispatch exit handoff task\n\n* feat(mecatui): print final session handoff\n\n* chore(plan): complete exit handoff task\n\n* docs(plan): mark session continuity landed\n\n* test(mecatui): refresh rebased header goldens\n\n* chore(plan): start panel repair wave\n\n* fix(session): preserve continuity across run handoffs\n\n* chore(plan): advance panel repair wave\n\n* fix(mecatui): make session continuity UX honest\n\n* docs(plan): complete session continuity repair wave\n\n* docs(acceptance): normalize caller identity criteria\n\n* fix(mecatui): compose startup and suspend lifecycle messages\n\n* chore: reconcile latest main\n\n* docs: refresh llms after rebase",
