          "id": "f8b37c98c89f0cd155702b08f798a2f2ead6866d",
          "message": "fix(mecatui): gofmt the glamour Enumeration comment block (#566 fallout) (#567)\n\nThe BlockPrefix comment inserted between Item: and Enumeration: broke\ngofmt's contiguous alignment group, leaving Item:'s padding stale — the\ngci/gofmt gate fails at main HEAD (and blocks every open PR's merge ref).\nOne-line mechanical gofmt.\n\nCo-authored-by: mecatl <noreply@stacklok.com>",
