          "id": "e58121c3cb42d504e9c56d6be54ef5a53ac92a24",
          "message": "docs: add Agent Fabric Protocol draft spec (#804)\n\nAdds the v0.1 draft spec for Fabric, a minimal HTTP/JSON protocol for\nremote filesystem-shaped access to files, tools, and subscriptions\n(9P resource model + MCP-style discoverable calls). Verbatim import\nfor now; formatting/tier-header alignment with docs/scoped-resource-grants.md\nto follow separately.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
