          "message": "fix(mecatui): preserve media in steer messages (#864)\n\n* fix(mecatui): preserve media in steer messages\n\nFixes #861\n\nCo-Authored-By: Juan Antonio Osorio <ozz@stacklok.com>\n\n* refactor(steer): remove pre-release compatibility shims\n\nCo-Authored-By: Juan Antonio Osorio <ozz@stacklok.com>\n\n* docs: renumber multimodal steer ADR\n\nCo-Authored-By: Juan Antonio Osorio <ozz@stacklok.com>",
