          "message": "feat(mecatui): add dedicated session debugger (#860)\n\nAdd an isolated session-debugging workflow with durable evidence, lineage, sanitized network-attempt reporting, and collision-free per-instance perf administration.\\n\\nCo-Authored-By: Juan Antonio Osorio <ozz@stacklok.com>",
