          "message": "feat(catalog): vendor all models.dev models + weekly CI refresh job (#255)\n\nDrop the hand-pinned 27-model openrouter allowlist and vendor ALL models\nfor the three in-scope providers (openai: 56, anthropic: 14, openrouter:\n345) from the latest models.dev/api.json snapshot (pinned 2026-07-13).\nNew models now visible: gpt-5.6 family, gpt-image-2, gpt-realtime-2.1,\nclaude-sonnet-5, plus 318 more openrouter routes.\n\nThe jq regeneration recipe no longer filters through a hand-maintained\n$orModels array — it's a uniform projection for all three providers.\nTests updated: floor+ceiling count bounds replace the exact-27 assertion;\nthe allowlist-exact test replaced with structural ID validation; test\nanchors referencing deprecated models (claude-3-5-haiku-20241022) updated\nto claude-haiku-4-5; live-only test model updated to a fabricated id now\nthat gpt-5.4 is catalogued.\n\nNew .github/workflows/catalog-refresh.yml runs weekly (Monday 07:00 UTC)\n+ manual workflow_dispatch: fetches models.dev/api.json, regenerates the\ncurated JSON via the deterministic jq -S filter, opens a PR with a count-\ndelta table if the file changed. Human-reviewed merge; providercatalog\ntests gate it under CI.",
