          "message": "chore: ignore personal local-state files, carry them into worktrees (#298)\n\nAdds gitignore entries for CLAUDE.local.md and HANDOFF.md (personal,\nper-contributor running-state files, not a project convention) plus a\n.worktreeinclude entry so CLAUDE.local.md travels into worktrees Claude\nCode creates. HANDOFF.md is deliberately left out since a new worktree\nis normally a new task.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
