          "id": "9e7862d8e02ad82a8ae9cbd0b7ae617f7cb4ac8e",
          "message": "feat(mecatui): render the fire-delivery card without the fence markers (#315)\n\nThe delivery card dumped the full recorded note — the <<<UNTRUSTED fence\nmarkers + the redundant \"[scheduled task … completed …]\" provenance header —\nas one muted blob, duplicating the assistant summary that follows. The fence\nand header are machine markers for the model (the trust boundary); the card\nalready carries the provenance in its label.\n\nrenderDelivery now strips the fence markers + redundant header for display and\nadds the fire id to the card label, so the operator sees just the fire's\noutcome body. The model's recorded history keeps the fence (the trust\nboundary is unchanged) — operator display and model history legitimately\ndiffer here. deliveryBodyForDisplay is fail-soft: a non-fenced note renders\nverbatim.\n\nCo-authored-by: mecatl <noreply@stacklok.com>",
