          "message": "chore(ci): bump stacklok/modelith (#316)\n\nBumps [stacklok/modelith](https://github.com/stacklok/modelith) from daf4a7559579dc631bfed52c1dee4458fc32457f to 26d8f41b42f445144ba0f14d0997a3b9eb9657f4.\n- [Release notes](https://github.com/stacklok/modelith/releases)\n- [Commits](https://github.com/stacklok/modelith/compare/daf4a7559579dc631bfed52c1dee4458fc32457f...26d8f41b42f445144ba0f14d0997a3b9eb9657f4)\n\n---\nupdated-dependencies:\n- dependency-name: stacklok/modelith\n  dependency-version: 26d8f41b42f445144ba0f14d0997a3b9eb9657f4\n  dependency-type: direct:production\n...\n\nSigned-off-by: dependabot[bot] <support@github.com>\nCo-authored-by: dependabot[bot] <49699333+dependabot[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>",
