          "message": "fix(mecatui): load provider keys from auth file\n\n* fix(mecatui): load provider keys from auth file\n\nCo-Authored-By: OpenAI <noreply@openai.com>\n\n* refactor(mecatui): reuse ansi warning wrapping\n\nCo-Authored-By: OpenAI <noreply@openai.com>\n\n* test(mecatui): cover auth-file startup\n\nMake the no-provider assertion independent of ToolHive, verify auth-file credentials reach embedded configuration, and cover warning emission before validation.\n\nCo-Authored-By: OpenAI <noreply@openai.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: OpenAI <noreply@openai.com>\nCo-authored-by: Jakub Hrozek <jakub@stacklok.com>",
