          "message": "fix(server): synchronize live subscription channels (#447)\n\n* fix(server): synchronize live subscription channels\n\nCo-Authored-By: mecatl <mecatl@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* test(server): stop subscription churn helper starving itself on CI\n\nThe publisher goroutines spun PublishSessionEvent in an unthrottled loop.\nOn a 2-core CI runner under -race that starves the churners, so the helper\nmissed the parent's 5s deadline and CI failed on\nTestSubscriptionConcurrentPublishAndUnsubscribe.\n\nYield after each publish, and raise the helper deadline to 60s — it bounds a\nhang, not the helper's runtime.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: mecatl <mecatl@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
