          "message": "feat(server): persist and reattach execution environments (#514)\n\n* feat(server): persist execution environments\n\n* feat(server): persist execution environments\n\n* fix(server): route no-fs override refs through defaultEnvironmentRef\n\nFour call sites still constructed session.EnvironmentRef{Kind:\nEnvKindNoFS, ID: \"\"} by hand instead of calling the single-source\nhelper the ref-persistence work (ADR 0106) introduced, so the\n\"collapsed duplicate derivation\" claim wasn't quite true. All four\nare behind profile == ProfileNoFS with sess in scope, so the value\nis unchanged.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Jakub Hrozek <jakub@stacklok.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
