          "message": "fix(cliconfig): word-wrap --help flag usage strings to a fixed width (#643)\n\nflag.PrintDefaults' continuation body used to render as a single >80-col\nline for long usage strings (e.g. --store-dir, --posture), overflowing\nnarrow terminals. wraps a rendered block through x/ansi.Wrap at\nhelpWrapWidth=84, re-indenting the \"    \\t\" continuation indent on\nevery wrapped line; short bodies stay byte-identical to the stdlib. Both\nexhaustive (PrintDefaultsExcluding) and grouped (PrintFlagDefault) help\ngo through the one formatter.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
