          "message": "fix(memory): scope-specific forget descriptions + diagnostics (#777)\n\n* docs(memory): scope-specific forget guidance + diagnostics (#fix-1/2/4)\n\n- forgetTool.Spec: scope-specific descriptions referencing matching\n  InspectMemory (project) / InspectUserMemory (user/user-model)\n- expected_version schema: opaque token, copy verbatim, never guess\n- storeFailure: scope-aware conflict messages; Actual==\"\" -> no current\n  record in selected scope (re-inspect); non-empty -> expected vs actual; no\n  raw err exposure\n- docs: architecture/memory.md, usage/skills-soul-usermodel.md,\n  user-docs/building/what-you-get/core-tools.md, user-docs/building/what-you-get/memory.md\n- tests: add TestForgetScopeDescriptionsAndExpectedVersionSchema,\n  TestStaleVersionConflictMessages (both scopes, stale + missing)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Juan Antonio Osorio <ozz@stacklok.com>\n\n* fix(memory): address lifecycle tool review\n\nCo-Authored-By: Juan Antonio Osorio <ozz@stacklok.com>",
