          "distinct": true,
          "id": "7bd3afced7758c0bae0ec6c9770f6a33a000ab46",
          "message": "feat(mcp): preserve typed content blocks, structured content, and resource links in tool results (#223)\n\nmecatl's MCP client adapter collapsed every MCP CallToolResult.content[] to a\nsingle string (flattenContent), discarding ResourceLink metadata, EmbeddedResource\nbodies, Image/Audio data, StructuredContent, and outputSchema. When an MCP tool\n(e.g. github MCP get_file) returned a resource, the model got a bare placeholder\nand the user saw nothing. This preserves typed content end-to-end per the MCP\n2025-06-18 spec.\n\nDomain (engine/session, additive, Added/minor):\n- ToolResult.Parts []Content — typed content blocks; zero-value = string-only\n  legacy (backward-compat: old sessions Load/Fold with nil Parts).\n- Content generalized with a BlockKind discriminator + block variants\n  (BlockText/BlockImage/BlockAudio/BlockResourceLink/BlockEmbeddedResource/\n  BlockStructuredContent) + fields (Text/Name/Title/Description/Size/Audience/\n  Priority/LastModified). NewResourceLinkBlock/NewEmbeddedResourceBlock/\n  NewStructuredContentBlock/NewTextBlock constructors. ValidateToolResultParts\n  (per-block + total byte caps, CWE-770). NewToolResultWithParts builder.\n  NewToolResult/NewToolError stay 2-arg (~200 call sites untouched).\n- ValidateResolvedIP — the dial-layer SSRF predicate (CWE-918) reused by the\n  fetch tool; shares the isGlobalUnicast definition with ValidateMediaURL.\n\nMCP adapter (internal/adapter/mcp/tool.go):\n- mapContent replaces flattenContent: mcpsdk.Content -> session.Content (neutral,\n  no mcpsdk.* in engine/). TextContent verbatim; Image/Audio via NewImageContent/\n  NewAudioContent (no second validation path); ResourceLink as a reference (URI+\n  name+desc+MIME, audience carried through — advisory-only, CWE-345, NEVER\n  suppresses model content); EmbeddedResource inline (text verbatim, binary\n  summarized); StructuredContent as a BlockStructuredContent + the spec-SHOULD\n  TextContent mirror. outputSchema captured; optional jsonschema-go defense-in-\n  depth validation (never session.ValidateJSON — fail-open subset validator).\n- toolkit.Truncate(MaxOutputBytes) applied to MCP results (closes #178).\n\nRouting (engine/port.RouteToolResultParts): a pure read-only capability-gated\nprojection — image iff caps.Image, audio iff caps.Audio, text/resource-link/\nembedded-resource always pass, audience never filters, nil -> degrade to string.\nPlaced in engine/port (the one layer both providers and composition import) so\nproviders call it without inverting layering. Never mutates recorded history\n(effective-payload guarantee intact).\n\nProviders (openai, anthropic): consume ToolResult.Parts when capability-routed\n(WithProviderCapabilities adapter Option, re-minted per-session — NOT an\nLLMRequest field, neutrality holds). Byte-identical legacy path when Parts empty.\n\nFetchMcpResource tool (internal/adapter/tools): https-only fetch of resource_link\nURIs via ValidateMediaURL (SSRF IP-deny) + CheckRedirect URL re-validation +\nssrfGuardedDialContext (ValidateResolvedIP on each resolved IP — closes the\nDNS-rebinding window at the dial layer). Non-https schemes guide to ReadMcpResource\nagainst the owning server. Per-call http.Client (no outlives-a-call resource).\nScopeBuiltinDefault floor-Allow; guardrail default block set (post-only).\n\nProto + relay: additive ToolResult.blocks + structured_content; new ContentBlock\nmessage. Relay mappers (blocksToProto/blocksFromProto). Fold reconstructs typed\nblocks for free (rides EvToolResult.ToolResult) — no sidecar.\n\nTUI: tool card surfaces resource-link/image blocks distinctly; existing goldens\nbyte-unchanged, new tool_mcp_card_blocks.golden.\n\nTests: TestMcpperfRoundTripResourceLinkPreserved (e2e: mecatl's own mcpperf\nserver -> mecatl client renders the user-audience resource_link — the broken\nround-trip fixed); TestLoopEmitsToolResultWithParts (full loop);\nTestFetchMcpResourceRedirectToInternalRejected + TestFetchMcpResourceDialLayer\nRejectsInternalIP (SSRF); TestValidateResolvedIP; provider byte-identical-legacy\ntests; TestFoldReconstructsTypedToolResult.\n\nDocs: ADR 0059 (the contract); CLOUD-NATIVE.md re-audit (no new List 1/List 2\nrow — value-object widening; FetchMcpResource http.Client is per-call);\nIMPLEMENTATION-NOTES.md, architecture.md, usage/mecated.md; perf-mcp-\ninterpretation skill updated (resource_link now surfaces as a typed block,\nfetchable via FetchMcpResource for https). engine/CHANGELOG.md Added entries.\n\nVerified: task lint (0 issues), task test (full suite green, -race), task\napi:check (Added/minor), task docs:check (0 broken links/anchors), go run\n./cmd/mecademo (full offline session).\n\nCloses #223. Refs #178.",
