          "id": "8cc11865f2d1de56fbdff53b85b58952d236edc6",
          "message": "feat(agent): surface team member StopError cause on team.* events (#331) (#403)\n\nMirror the #319 SubagentPayload.Cause design onto TeamPayload: a team\nmember whose round ends in StopError now carries the loop's\nResultPayload.Error on its per-round EvTeamMember (InnerKind=EvResult),\nnormalised through the shared subagentCausePayload chokepoint\n(whitespace-collapsed, rune-clamped to 400) at the single emit site\nprojectTeamEvent. Client-only (gauntlet #7 — harness/provider metadata,\nnever member-authored output); the terminal EvTeamEnd disposition stays\nclosed-enum and writeTeamStatus is unchanged. Threaded end-to-end:\nproto Team.cause (field 19) -> toProtoTeam -> ACP teamMemberLine\n(\"<member> failed: <cause>\") -> mecatui TeamMsg/teamLane -> the team\nfocus pane's \"failed:\" block, rendered only for a member benched on\nerror (last non-empty cause wins; a recovered done member renders\nnothing).\n\nThe ADR-0079 trip-wire comment records the current state: the shared\nnormaliser now crosses Subagent + Team, Parallel deliberately omits\nCause, and the 4th-family ChildActivity extraction bar stands.\n\nEngine public surface: session.TeamPayload.Cause is Added (minor) per\nCOMPATIBILITY.md — api/session.txt regenerated, CHANGELOG entry added.\n\nCo-authored-by: mecatl <mecatl@stacklok.com>",
