          "id": "6b5ef1457d3945c249d6bd7e1b4ac9046e900e5f",
          "message": "fix(mecatui): ordered-list marker keeps its \". \" separator (#566)\n\nglamour v2 renders an ordered-list number from Styles.Enumeration, and\nthe marker-to-text separator is that style's BlockPrefix (stock glamour\nstyles set \". \"; see glamour styles.go). mecatui's from-scratch\nGlamourStyle set only a colour, so ordered lists rendered the number\nglued to the text (\"1.First item\").\n\nSet BlockPrefix on Enumeration and pin the rendered shape with a\nregression test so a style refactor can't silently drop it again.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>",
          "timestamp": "2026-08-15T09:45:17-07:00",
          "tree_id": "ecc3f224409e8e40e609bb85a01047f5e9b2a233",
