          "message": "docs: add importable engine first-agent path (#748)\n\n* docs: add first-agent learning path\n\nCo-Authored-By: OpenAI <noreply@openai.com>\n\n* docs: add runnable first-agent example\n\nCo-Authored-By: OpenAI <noreply@openai.com>\n\n* docs: add first custom tool example\n\nCo-Authored-By: OpenAI <noreply@openai.com>\n\n* docs: add first-agent approval example\n\nCo-Authored-By: OpenAI <noreply@openai.com>\n\n* docs: add OpenRouter first-agent path\n\nCo-Authored-By: OpenAI <noreply@openai.com>\n\n* docs: use luna in OpenRouter example\n\nCo-Authored-By: OpenAI <noreply@openai.com>\n\n* docs: add engine extension roadmap\n\nCo-Authored-By: OpenAI <noreply@openai.com>\n\n* docs: add engine compatibility guidance\n\nCo-Authored-By: OpenAI <noreply@openai.com>\n\n* examples: add package documentation\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: OpenAI <noreply@openai.com>",
