          "id": "1eb96b88dd41aebacc0948b70965a0a73730b230",
          "message": "fix(server): enforce workspace authority for teams (#765)\n\nRoute CreateTeam through the same listener-scoped workspace authority gate as every other filesystem-bearing creation path. This rejects caller-selected roots before a workspace or command runner can be constructed, while allowing an empty workspace to resolve to the server-assigned root.\n\nExercise gRPC and HTTP team creation under server-assigned authority and document the route in ADR 0237.",
