          "id": "42a4c8a5ee00d5d977a75265780c85144125d3f8",
          "message": "feat(release): publish the mecak8s image to GHCR (#781)\n\ndeploy/helm/mecak8s/values.yaml's default image.repository\n(ghcr.io/stacklok/mecatl/mecak8s) pointed at an image that has never\nexisted: release.yml only ever built mecated and mecatui, and\nk8s-e2e.yml's mecak8s build is a local-only ko.local ref loaded\nstraight into the runner's Docker daemon, never pushed to a real\nregistry. This is more fundamental than the imagePullSecrets gap\nfixed in #776/v0.0.17 — there was nothing to pull at all.\n\nAdds publish-mecak8s, mirroring publish-mecatui's exact build/sign/\nSBOM/attest pipeline for ./cmd/mecak8s (already a named build target\nin .ko.yaml — no build-config change needed).\n\nVerified locally: `go build ./cmd/mecak8s` compiles, and\n`ko build --local ./cmd/mecak8s` produces a working image (`docker\nrun ... --help` prints the mecak8s CLI flags) using the correct\ndistroless base and build flags from .ko.yaml.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
