          "distinct": true,
          "id": "b7ca4a6359e44b4f7418efc2cbf89dcdbfcf11f4",
          "message": "feat(mecak8s): add ToolHive-free local Kind fixture (#796)\n\n* feat(mecak8s-vmcp): support external Keycloak delegation\n\nCo-Authored-By: mecatl <noreply@stacklok.com>\n\n* chore(mecak8s-vmcp): pin ToolHive and document workarounds\n\nCo-Authored-By: mecatl <noreply@stacklok.com>\n\n* feat(mecak8s): add ToolHive-free Kind fixture\n\nCo-Authored-By: mecatl <noreply@mecatl.dev>\n\n* feat(mecak8s-kind): add explicit provider modes\n\nCo-Authored-By: mecatl <noreply@mecatl.dev>\n\n* feat(mecak8s-kind): add optional Keycloak overlay\n\nCo-Authored-By: mecatl <mecatl@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* feat(mecak8s-kind): secure Keycloak loopback fixture\n\nCo-Authored-By: mecatl <noreply@stacklok.com>\n\n* fix(mecak8s-vmcp): retain delegation fixture\n\nCo-Authored-By: mecatl <noreply@stacklok.com>\n\n* fix(docs): keep Kind fixture reference local\n\nCo-Authored-By: mecatl <noreply@stacklok.com>\n\n* docs: regenerate corpus index\n\nCo-Authored-By: mecatl <noreply@stacklok.com>\n\n* fix(mecak8s-vmcp): document PKCE-vs-password-grant login boundary\n\nCI's TestMecak8sKindFixture_Scenario3_LoginDocumentation requires every\nKeycloak-login doc to name Authorization Code + PKCE as the normal flow\nbefore mentioning the password grant test helper; deploy/mecak8s-vmcp/README.md\nwas missing this and had no test.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* docs: regenerate corpus index after rebase onto main\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* docs: regenerate corpus index after rebase onto docs + steer-flake fixes\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(deploycheck): drop the retired vmcp live-provider Taskfile check\n\n#800 added TestMecak8sVMCPLiveProviderUsesExplicitLocalUnsafeMode against\ndeploy/mecak8s-vmcp/Taskfile.yml's chart-apply live-provider branch, but\nthis branch (this whole operational lifecycle, in fact) was retired by\nthis branch's own earlier \"add ToolHive-free Kind fixture\" commit --\ndeploy/mecak8s-vmcp/Taskfile.yml now holds only the historical vmcp-check\nreference task, so the test's target no longer exists after the rebase.\n\nThe equivalent safety property is now proven on the deploy/mecak8s-kind\npath instead: kind-provider-real.yaml carries its own explicit\nsecurity.allowUnsafeRealProvider: true (this rebase's own fix, since\nvalues.schema.json's new gate from #800 would otherwise reject it), and\nTestMecak8sHelmChart_KindFixtureRealProviderDisablesMock proves that\noverlay renders.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* docs: regenerate corpus index after rebase onto main (#800)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* docs: regenerate corpus index after rebase onto main\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: mecatl <noreply@stacklok.com>\nCo-authored-by: mecatl <noreply@mecatl.dev>\nCo-authored-by: mecatl <mecatl@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
